WEBVTT

00:02.585 --> 00:05.380
Long ago, in the caves along this cape,

00:05.463 --> 00:08.174
there was a prosperous kingdom
called Romonon,

00:08.258 --> 00:11.344
renowned for its exquisitely crafted
magical works.

00:12.679 --> 00:14.764
They adorned themselves
with magical goldwork

00:14.848 --> 00:18.143
and made little effort
to hide their arrogance.

00:18.226 --> 00:21.438
They looked down on the lands
beyond the caves and their travelers,

00:21.521 --> 00:24.733
seeing them as lesser
and separate from themselves.

00:25.734 --> 00:28.486
As tales of Romonon's wealth
spread far and wide,

00:28.570 --> 00:30.822
more visitors began arriving
from the surface.

00:31.322 --> 00:34.868
To admit only those they deemed worthy,

00:34.951 --> 00:38.830
they built the Serpentback Path,
where only the chosen could pass.

00:39.789 --> 00:45.712
And to ensure that the unworthy
could never reach Romonon,

00:45.795 --> 00:48.840
they carved a labyrinth spell
into the cave.

00:49.841 --> 00:52.635
Romonon grew ever more beautiful
and prosperous,

00:52.719 --> 00:55.221
but more arrogant and isolated as well.

00:55.305 --> 00:56.139
At some point,

00:56.848 --> 01:00.810
the people of Romonon
began judging one another's worth.

01:01.978 --> 01:03.855
Those deemed worthless

01:04.439 --> 01:06.816
were transformed by magic

01:07.442 --> 01:10.987
into the very goldwork
that adorned the city.

01:11.905 --> 01:14.532
Just as stagnant water turns foul,

01:14.616 --> 01:17.160
Romonon, sealed off from the world,
began to decay.

01:18.161 --> 01:22.290
They turned against one another
and grew weary and weak with resentment.

01:22.791 --> 01:26.669
In the end, the kingdom collapsed under
the weight of its own mountains of gold.

01:27.587 --> 01:30.757
All that remained was the Serpentback Path

01:30.840 --> 01:33.510
and the caves,
transformed into a labyrinth.

01:35.345 --> 01:37.514
People can be truly frightening.

01:38.098 --> 01:40.850
How we're so easily capable
of terrible things,

01:40.934 --> 01:43.645
and how few people realize it.

01:45.146 --> 01:46.523
But, Master...

01:48.108 --> 01:51.277
Magic is supposed to make people happy,
isn't it?

01:51.945 --> 01:55.907
It's a power meant to help people
and bring color to the world, right?!

01:58.409 --> 02:01.746
If future witches like you
truly believe that,

02:01.830 --> 02:02.872
then I'm sure...

02:03.832 --> 02:06.292
You're right. It'll all be all right!

02:08.628 --> 02:09.546
Though

02:10.130 --> 02:14.217
this particular spell may have
unfortunate consequences for dinner.

02:15.176 --> 02:18.555
Oh no! It's totally burnt!

02:19.222 --> 02:20.348
Ooh, hot!

02:20.431 --> 02:23.434
If we take off the burnt parts,
it's still edible! Yum!

02:24.018 --> 02:27.105
Magic is a power
meant to bring color to the world...

02:28.398 --> 02:30.942
I hope that's true.

02:32.235 --> 02:33.528
I truly do.

04:07.872 --> 04:10.416
Now, how will you proceed?

04:10.917 --> 04:13.670
I'm only the proctor.
From here on, you're on your own.

04:13.753 --> 04:15.046
ROMONON'S SHADOW

04:15.129 --> 04:18.424
It's twisty,
but there's only one path forward.

04:18.925 --> 04:20.343
This is easy.

04:21.803 --> 04:23.471
I'll just fly and be done with--

04:31.187 --> 04:32.272
Watch out!

04:37.277 --> 04:39.112
You're standing sideways?

04:39.195 --> 04:40.989
Is it your magic?

04:41.656 --> 04:43.866
This is the magic of the path.

04:44.450 --> 04:47.287
The space inside this cave
has been completely warped.

04:47.370 --> 04:49.664
The only correct route on level ground

04:49.747 --> 04:51.874
is along this Serpent's back.

04:51.958 --> 04:55.878
Step off it
and you'll fall into the cave labyrinth

04:55.962 --> 04:58.464
and end up right back at the entrance.

04:59.465 --> 05:00.758
Don't tell me,

05:01.342 --> 05:03.553
these serpent-scale paving stones...

05:04.595 --> 05:06.889
Are they all magic seals?

05:08.266 --> 05:11.644
But some are cracked and crumbled.

05:12.437 --> 05:14.772
That's why I failed the exam
the first time.

05:14.856 --> 05:16.983
I never realized what they were.

05:17.483 --> 05:20.778
The answer is in
the basic magic textbook--

05:20.862 --> 05:22.363
That spell.

05:31.372 --> 05:33.916
Water flows according to gravity.

05:34.000 --> 05:36.753
And on a level surface,
it pools and stays put.

05:37.920 --> 05:41.341
If only the sections where the seals
are still intact are level,

05:41.924 --> 05:46.596
then the spots where water collects
mark the path you can safely walk.

05:47.180 --> 05:49.098
That's exactly right.

05:49.182 --> 05:51.684
Wow, you are from the Arklaum Family.

05:52.185 --> 05:55.730
Even on my second attempt, I wasn't...

05:55.813 --> 05:57.357
The right answer.

05:58.107 --> 05:59.650
The right spell.

06:01.069 --> 06:02.695
The right path.

06:03.696 --> 06:06.157
Being told we can't stray from them.

06:06.240 --> 06:09.369
That's exactly what I hate the most.

06:09.869 --> 06:11.704
Hey, Richelitte.

06:12.705 --> 06:15.416
You're drawing useless spells again.

06:15.917 --> 06:19.337
You'll never become
a proper witch like that.

06:20.171 --> 06:23.466
Why can't you listen
and do as your master says?

06:24.926 --> 06:28.221
Throw these doodles away.

06:31.682 --> 06:33.309
I don't want to.

06:33.810 --> 06:35.895
They're not doodles.

06:35.978 --> 06:38.064
This is my magic.

06:39.732 --> 06:41.692
I don't want to throw myself away.

06:42.193 --> 06:43.736
Which means...

06:46.072 --> 06:48.157
This way. Come on.

06:50.660 --> 06:52.537
I know which path to take,

06:52.620 --> 06:55.081
but the myrphon won't follow me.

06:55.581 --> 06:56.707
Come on!

06:56.791 --> 07:00.336
It's dangerous if you fall, so stay close!

07:06.384 --> 07:09.637
Don't think I'll forgive you
just because you're acting cute.

07:09.720 --> 07:11.013
But

07:12.098 --> 07:13.933
that behavior is the important part.

07:14.642 --> 07:17.437
Myrphons communicate with each other
through their calls.

07:17.520 --> 07:20.773
So when you want them to follow you,

07:20.857 --> 07:24.444
the correct approach is to use
a resonance spell to mimic their call...

07:24.986 --> 07:25.820
Huh?

07:28.698 --> 07:31.200
There's no one right way to do magic.

07:32.410 --> 07:35.329
There are no rules saying
it has to be done a certain way.

07:35.913 --> 07:37.081
The myrphon...

07:37.165 --> 07:40.877
You may have taken this test before,
Euini,

07:40.960 --> 07:43.588
but you keep going on
about the "right answer."

07:44.172 --> 07:46.924
And all that explaining before we even try
is just meddling.

07:47.717 --> 07:49.844
I just want to be myself.

07:49.927 --> 07:52.930
I don't want to be some other witch
that's not me.

07:53.931 --> 07:56.851
That's why I'm going to make it
to the end of this path,

07:56.934 --> 07:59.103
only using my own magic.

08:02.231 --> 08:04.859
But that's impossible.

08:05.610 --> 08:08.070
The world doesn't work that way.

08:08.571 --> 08:10.490
This is an exam, after all.

08:10.573 --> 08:12.992
There has to be a correct answer.

08:13.576 --> 08:16.287
We're still inexperienced.
We're apprentices.

08:16.370 --> 08:19.582
We're just kids,
so we have to follow the textbook.

08:20.082 --> 08:22.251
Or I'll fail again.

08:22.335 --> 08:24.462
I mean, that's what exams are.

08:24.962 --> 08:27.757
I hate being told
that's just how things are.

08:27.840 --> 08:31.344
But if it's a spell nobody's tried before.
It might fail.

08:31.427 --> 08:33.221
You do it so that it works.

08:33.304 --> 08:34.138
That's crazy--

08:34.222 --> 08:37.517
You can learn from your failures.

08:37.600 --> 08:39.602
They can become your strength.

08:40.603 --> 08:43.356
I know someone who learns that way.

08:44.732 --> 08:46.984
You should do what you want, Richeh.

08:47.610 --> 08:49.237
It's none of my business.

08:49.946 --> 08:52.114
I don't need you to tell me that, Agott.

09:09.382 --> 09:12.218
What's that sound? Water?

09:16.430 --> 09:17.473
I...

09:17.557 --> 09:20.518
I'm told by my master every day.

09:21.269 --> 09:22.562
"You'll never be able."

09:22.645 --> 09:24.272
"You can't do it."

09:25.147 --> 09:26.524
I believe him.

09:27.650 --> 09:31.237
That's why I studied how others do things.

09:32.572 --> 09:34.574
But it still didn't work.

09:36.158 --> 09:38.202
Because this is Romonon.

09:40.746 --> 09:42.456
This path

09:42.540 --> 09:45.835
was created to keep out
those who weren't chosen to begin with.

09:51.841 --> 09:53.801
Coco, what's wrong?

09:54.385 --> 09:55.720
Master Qifrey,

09:55.803 --> 09:59.015
are there any other witches
around here today?

09:59.098 --> 10:00.975
Kukrow left already,

10:01.058 --> 10:03.894
so I don't think so. Why do you ask?

10:04.395 --> 10:07.982
I thought I saw someone
in a robe over there.

10:22.079 --> 10:24.415
Of course no one would be here.

10:26.709 --> 10:29.503
Yes! I'm coming!

10:41.057 --> 10:42.808
The water's flowing down.

10:42.892 --> 10:45.853
But halfway through,
it starts falling in a strange direction.

10:46.354 --> 10:48.314
If the path is broken,

10:48.397 --> 10:52.151
then the seals on the underside
of those stones won't work either.

10:52.777 --> 10:55.029
We have to find a way to cross.

10:57.365 --> 11:00.785
The seal only affects you
while you're standing on the stones.

11:01.410 --> 11:04.789
So we just extend the stones all the way
to the path over there.

11:08.000 --> 11:09.168
Like this.

11:18.844 --> 11:22.014
She's staying on the stone ribbon?

11:25.434 --> 11:26.268
See?

11:27.061 --> 11:31.023
If something can't be done,
then you just change it so it can.

11:33.109 --> 11:34.985
You may be on to something.

11:45.496 --> 11:47.248
Oh, watch out!

11:47.331 --> 11:48.457
At that rate...

11:53.003 --> 11:56.173
A combination of recreation
and repetition magic.

11:56.257 --> 11:59.427
The range is limited, but it worked.

12:01.887 --> 12:03.139
Agott!

12:03.222 --> 12:04.056
It's fine!

12:09.395 --> 12:12.523
I can't draw carefully under a cloak,

12:12.606 --> 12:15.192
so it doesn't last and fades immediately.

12:15.693 --> 12:19.155
I've still got a long way to go.
I need to work a lot harder.

12:19.780 --> 12:21.824
That wasn't too bad.

12:21.907 --> 12:23.284
A piece of cake.

12:24.785 --> 12:26.287
You're up next, aren't you?

12:31.876 --> 12:32.960
I...

12:33.043 --> 12:34.128
I...

12:35.296 --> 12:37.089
I can't do it!

12:38.674 --> 12:40.426
I'm not cut out for this!

12:40.509 --> 12:44.847
I don't have talent, courage, confidence,
aptitude, or even a special skill!

12:44.930 --> 12:47.641
The path is crumbling.
I don't even have luck!

12:48.142 --> 12:49.560
I know I'm gonna fail again!

12:49.643 --> 12:50.728
Oh, come on.

12:50.811 --> 12:55.566
You've been showing off your analysis
and knowledge from the start.

12:55.649 --> 12:58.986
What's the point, if you don't use
your experience of trying it twice?

12:59.612 --> 13:01.781
Just draw something.

13:14.877 --> 13:16.670
A sound spell?

13:18.339 --> 13:20.716
A rain spell to make a puddle?

13:22.176 --> 13:25.638
Those are spells for areas
we've already passed!

13:25.721 --> 13:28.265
You need something new to get across.

13:29.600 --> 13:31.227
I can't.

13:31.727 --> 13:32.728
What?

13:33.229 --> 13:35.397
I...

13:35.981 --> 13:38.192
I can't stop my hands from shaking.

13:40.486 --> 13:43.405
Whenever I've had to draw
in front of other people,

13:44.073 --> 13:46.408
I've never managed to do it right.

13:47.076 --> 13:48.577
If I think someone is watching,

13:48.661 --> 13:50.663
I start sweating. My hand slips.

13:50.746 --> 13:52.790
I shake. My lines go crooked.

13:53.749 --> 13:55.876
Every spell turns out terrible.

13:56.377 --> 13:58.796
I want to fix it,

13:59.463 --> 14:02.216
but I don't know how.

14:03.425 --> 14:08.013
And... when people see me
panicking and trembling,

14:08.097 --> 14:10.099
it only gets worse.

14:12.059 --> 14:14.395
So this time,

14:14.478 --> 14:16.313
I studied ahead. I prepared.

14:16.939 --> 14:21.569
I drew all the "correct" spells
I thought I might need in advance.

14:22.152 --> 14:25.573
I can still focus when I'm by myself.

14:26.156 --> 14:29.034
And there's no rule against bringing
a palm quire.

14:30.244 --> 14:32.955
Then all I'd have to do
is close the ring to activate it.

14:33.038 --> 14:36.208
I thought maybe this way,
I could look competent.

14:37.543 --> 14:40.462
But I never expected the path
to be broken.

14:41.463 --> 14:44.466
I got punished for not doing things
the right way.

14:45.217 --> 14:47.720
Why am I always like this?

14:48.304 --> 14:50.806
You said you wanted to be yourself.

14:51.307 --> 14:54.476
But me? If I could, I'd stop being me.

14:55.185 --> 14:57.855
I'd rather be someone other than me.

15:00.024 --> 15:00.858
This exam

15:01.442 --> 15:02.985
is meant to test whether you can

15:03.068 --> 15:05.821
use magic without being discovered,
even in front of the Outsiders.

15:06.322 --> 15:10.200
Sorry, but by the looks of things,
I doubt he'd ever pass.

15:10.284 --> 15:11.577
You can do it.

15:12.453 --> 15:15.039
You can do it as Euini.

15:15.539 --> 15:17.458
You had the answer already.

15:17.958 --> 15:19.126
Didn't you notice?

15:19.835 --> 15:22.046
If you can focus when you're alone,

15:22.129 --> 15:23.881
then just make yourself alone now!

15:24.465 --> 15:25.633
What?

15:25.716 --> 15:27.593
Huh? What?

15:28.302 --> 15:30.304
But how?

15:30.387 --> 15:31.513
However you need to!

15:32.014 --> 15:33.891
Magic can stretch stone.

15:33.974 --> 15:36.226
It can make it rain.

15:36.310 --> 15:39.271
So it ought to be able to make a room
where you can be alone too.

15:39.355 --> 15:42.274
But I can't draw that spell...

15:42.358 --> 15:43.776
Then do it without magic!

15:43.859 --> 15:45.402
What?

15:45.486 --> 15:49.531
Don't spring something so crazy on me...

15:50.115 --> 15:51.200
I...

16:12.179 --> 16:13.305
You--

16:14.932 --> 16:15.933
Don't interfere.

16:18.727 --> 16:21.772
I hate this. This is the worst!

16:22.272 --> 16:23.899
How pathetic can I be?

16:24.483 --> 16:27.444
That this was what I came up with.

16:27.528 --> 16:29.613
It's so pathetic I could cry.

16:30.114 --> 16:32.866
Those girls must be fed up with me.

16:33.784 --> 16:35.035
Maybe they're laughing.

16:35.536 --> 16:38.956
From the outside, I must look ridiculous.

16:39.456 --> 16:41.834
Just imagining myself,

16:41.917 --> 16:43.877
I'd think I was ridiculous too.

16:44.670 --> 16:48.007
Even the master must be disappointed.

16:51.051 --> 16:52.553
No one's laughing.

16:53.220 --> 16:55.889
No one's fed up or laughing.

16:55.973 --> 16:57.891
No one's making fun of me.

16:58.475 --> 17:00.769
No one but myself.

17:02.980 --> 17:06.275
Just find a way to do it, huh?

17:06.859 --> 17:07.985
I see.

17:08.485 --> 17:11.739
The only one casting a curse
saying I can't

17:12.614 --> 17:15.117
is me, who I see in the mirror.

17:18.746 --> 17:19.913
The mirror...

17:22.833 --> 17:23.667
Here.

17:24.251 --> 17:25.753
No, here.

17:26.879 --> 17:29.298
The seal on the Mirror Cloak
of Borrowshade...

17:30.090 --> 17:31.675
It's not really a mirror,

17:31.759 --> 17:33.927
but more an application of arrows
to conceal and reflect.

17:34.011 --> 17:36.889
It hides the wearer by turning them
into a "shadow,"

17:37.389 --> 17:41.310
then projects the image of a giant beast
reflected in the scales.

17:42.269 --> 17:44.188
Amazing.

17:44.271 --> 17:46.565
There are multiple layers of spells
woven together.

17:47.232 --> 17:49.568
But if that's the case,

17:49.651 --> 17:50.694
then maybe I can...

18:09.963 --> 18:11.048
What's wrong?

18:12.174 --> 18:13.342
Euini?

18:14.176 --> 18:15.135
Stay there.

18:15.636 --> 18:17.221
I'll put up a Wind Wall.

18:18.806 --> 18:22.059
Is it a Romonon trap?
Or some unknown ancient spell?

18:22.559 --> 18:24.353
I'm fine!

18:25.145 --> 18:27.856
This is my spell.

18:27.940 --> 18:29.358
Euini!

18:33.946 --> 18:34.947
You!

18:36.281 --> 18:37.991
What did you do to the cloak?

18:39.284 --> 18:40.702
When I went inside,

18:40.786 --> 18:43.622
I could see the seal
on the Mirror Cloak of Borrowshade,

18:43.705 --> 18:45.958
so I erased the part for the "mirror"

18:46.041 --> 18:48.669
and turned it into a cloak
that only "borrows shadows."

18:49.461 --> 18:53.382
This way, I can stay hidden
in the darkness and keep drawing.

18:53.465 --> 18:55.801
The myrphon won't see me either.

18:55.884 --> 18:57.886
It does make it harder
to bring them along,

18:57.970 --> 19:00.514
but I have a sound spell
that mimics their calls.

19:00.597 --> 19:03.392
As long as they don't realize I'm human, right?

19:03.475 --> 19:05.144
Technically, I suppose.

19:05.769 --> 19:08.438
If I can hide myself, then I'll be alone.

19:08.522 --> 19:11.525
I can focus. I don't have to be afraid
of people watching.

19:11.608 --> 19:14.862
I thought maybe I could draw this way.

19:29.710 --> 19:33.505
I know doing it this way
is kind of embarrassing,

19:33.589 --> 19:34.882
but maybe...

19:37.301 --> 19:40.012
this is who I am.

19:45.851 --> 19:48.520
Do you still hate yourself?

19:49.855 --> 19:50.731
No.

19:51.481 --> 19:52.524
Not as much.

19:55.360 --> 19:58.197
Next time, don't be so quick
to say it's impossible.

19:58.280 --> 20:00.407
You're not hopeless at all, Euini.

20:00.490 --> 20:02.618
I probably will though.

20:02.701 --> 20:06.079
But I'll do my best not to stop there.

20:07.497 --> 20:08.540
Um!

20:11.585 --> 20:14.004
Thank you, Richeh.

20:15.923 --> 20:19.051
I thought you weren't interested
in other people.

20:19.134 --> 20:22.304
Euini helped me in the beginning.

20:22.387 --> 20:23.555
Now we're even.

20:24.473 --> 20:25.515
Besides,

20:26.683 --> 20:29.144
to want to do something
and not be able to,

20:30.687 --> 20:32.231
I know what that feels like.

20:33.899 --> 20:37.444
Of course you hate
that version of yourself.

20:37.527 --> 20:39.446
That's why you can grow.

20:40.405 --> 20:43.200
I'm going to become more than I am now.

20:43.700 --> 20:46.787
There's no way I could love
my still immature self.

20:50.374 --> 20:53.043
Exams are for you to know yourself.

20:53.543 --> 20:55.545
The path may have one route,

20:55.629 --> 20:57.756
but everyone draws
their magic differently.

20:58.382 --> 21:03.387
Each person has to find their own way
and decide how they'll walk it.

21:04.513 --> 21:06.306
And you keep repeating the process.

21:06.807 --> 21:09.768
See? Exams aren't so bad, are they?

21:13.772 --> 21:14.606
But...

21:16.024 --> 21:18.652
Master Qifrey tricked me
into taking the exam.

21:18.735 --> 21:21.363
I'm not forgiving him until he apologizes.

21:21.446 --> 21:23.282
He's already at one Mad-Richeh point.

21:24.324 --> 21:25.742
Mad-Richeh point?

21:27.035 --> 21:30.038
Speaking of Qifrey,

21:30.539 --> 21:33.041
hasn't he been kind of--

21:37.337 --> 21:38.755
- Master Alaira!
- Master Alaira!

21:38.839 --> 21:40.632
A Brimmed Cap?!

21:43.218 --> 21:44.303
A Brimmed Cap?

21:49.266 --> 21:52.561
Listen, all of you! Don't listen to a word
the Brimmed Caps say!

21:52.644 --> 21:55.814
Don't let them deceive you!
Run as fast as you can!

21:56.315 --> 21:57.816
Forbidden magic is--

22:02.654 --> 22:04.031
Ms. Alaira...

23:33.787 --> 23:35.997
Subtitle translation by: Emily Noguchi

23:37.040 --> 23:41.002
EPISODE 13
FORBIDDEN MAGIC
